      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tifton%2C_Georgia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Georgia Museum of Agriculture & Historic Village, formerly Agrirama, sits in Tifton and showcases life from the 1870s to 1910s.",
